      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akiyar anakica",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikwapei iraakatar iyes ŋidwe ka Akuj ŋuluminan, itemokino iyes kituputo iŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itemokino iyes kiboiyete alotooma amina lopite ŋolopei abunio Kristo itominakinia iwon, ido tojal akiyar keŋ aŋuna yok erae amuronot ŋina akukunyon, ŋina ecamuna ka ŋina italakarit Akuj.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikwapei iraakatar iyes ŋituŋa ŋulu ka Akuj, nyitemokino ŋakiro daadaŋ ŋuna ka amalao kori ŋuna ka asiilyanut kori arorokanut elimitoe alokidiŋ kus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyejok daŋ iyes irworosi ŋakiro ŋuna a ŋileec, ŋuna a ŋiyany kori ŋuna ke erasi. Nai itemokino tolakanaros neni ka Akuj. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toyenete nai atemar emam ituŋanan ŋini amalaanan, asiilyanan kori ŋini arorokanan (anerae ikwaan arorokanut ka akilip akuj ace) ŋini eyakaun Napukan ŋina a Kristo ka Akuj.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyicamut idiotuŋanan ikimodikini iyes a ŋakiro a ŋuna ka amodiyo; anerae aŋuna a ŋakiro a ŋun, ebuni anyunyura ŋina ka Akuj neni a ŋulu nyepupete ŋakiro keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, nyirukito ka ŋituŋa ŋulu ikote nen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyakasi paaran sek iyes nakiryonut, nai aŋuna ka akimorikina kus ka Ekapolon, iyakasi tokona iyes nakica. Aŋun, itemokino iyes kiboiyete ikwa ŋituŋa ŋulu erae ŋulu ka akica, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anerae eyauni akica nu erae arait: ajokis, akiyookino ka akirworo ŋuna a kire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kikatakisi ayenun ŋuna italakarito Ekapolon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyilomanarete nakiro ŋuna koŋinae ŋuna ka akiryonut, nai kisileereutu ikes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Nai erae ŋileec nooi iyes tari akirworo ŋakiro ŋuna itiyaete ŋituŋa ŋul anakimunono.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai ani isileereunio ŋakiro daadaŋ anakica, apaki ŋin nai itoodiunere ŋipitesyo kec ejok; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anerae akica iŋes itoodiuni ibore daadaŋ ejok. Iŋes elimunitere ebe,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋaberu ka ŋikilyok",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Topuponoros make aŋuna ka akerit kus Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋaberu, topupete ŋikilyok kus, ikwaŋina ipupyoto Ekapolon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anerae epolokinit ekile aberu keŋ, ikwaŋina epolokinitor Kristo Ŋikristo; erae Kristo elope iŋes ekaiunan ŋolo a Ŋikristo, a ŋulu erae akuwan keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikwaŋina epupyoto Ŋikristo Kristo, itemokino ŋaberu daŋ topupete jik ŋikilyok kec.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋikilyok, tominas ŋaberu kus, ikwaŋina aminar Kristo Ŋikristo, ido tojal akiyar keŋ aŋuna kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Kristo kitiya ŋun aŋuna ka ainakin ikes neni ka Akuj, kedau akitesegun ikes a ŋakipi a ŋuna ke ebatisimu ka alotooma akirot keŋ; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ikotere eyauni atukot a Ŋikristo neni keŋ erae ateran anakibuses keŋ a daadaŋ--tomam akemer, nyerinyit ereet, kori tomam ibore daadaŋ ŋini nyitesegi iŋes; aŋun, epedori ayakau kiŋaren keŋ erae ŋina ajokan nooi ka ŋina eseg alotau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikwaŋinapei, itemokino ŋikilyok daŋ tominas ŋaberu kec ikwaŋina eminatar ikes ŋawat kec a ŋilopeyek. Ekile ŋolo emina aberu keŋ, emina iŋes akuwan keŋ ke elope. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emam ituŋanan ŋini itidiŋit akuwan keŋ a ilope. Akilo, itani ka irici iŋes, ikwaŋina iricitor Kristo atukot a Ŋikristo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anerae ikirae iwon ŋinerin ŋulu ka akuwan keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikwapei igiritere Nakigireta ebe, “Aŋun, eesikini ekile papa keŋ ka toto keŋ, kimorikinos ka akeeberu, toruworos ŋuluarei ŋul apeikuwan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eya Nakigireta ŋun ŋakiro ŋuna ajokak ŋuna imunono, ŋuna ayenu ayoŋ atemar ikamunito Kristo ka atukot a Ŋikristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai ikikamunito iyes daŋ ŋakigireta ŋun: itemokino ŋolokile tomina aberu keŋ, ikwaŋina eminar iŋes akuwan keŋ ke elope; itemokino ŋinaberu tokerite lokile keŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
